SUMMARY:SPN — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: SESI LLC (SPN)\nRoadshow: https://evercall.co/oacc/16762\n\nDeal c
 ontext:\nSESI\, L.L.C. (ticker: SPN) is launching a $200mm fungible add-on
  to its existing Senior Secured Notes due September 30\, 2030\, bringing t
 he pro-forma outstanding to $975mm on the same terms as the existing notes
  (NC through September 30\, 2027\, equity claw up to 40% at par+100% coupo
 n). Proceeds will fund the cash consideration for the acquisition of Sonic
 \, with Goldman Sachs acting as left lead alongside JPM\, BofA\, FITB\, MS
 \, and Texas Capital. An investor call is scheduled for Tuesday\, June 7\,
  2026 at 10:00AM EST with the deal expected to price today.
